4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0Fo9wWBr4vkQ7kNvwFl8-P-&_nc_oc=Ado2SWM9e2wMMKLxUX3rGUp7NpQcyfXTRQoxuusPY43XWxqNR0MbU_aX-j0dQsgsqQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0qVEe9YwwA8Z_ku1oEn7NUFi2rExQLaJfkKl35riFvjg&oe=69EE0D54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vToDHSFft9QQ7kNvwFfrfg3&_nc_oc=AdqHm7A2Nn4uj5XL_30cRYwKUW9EJPY9KdRo4cjNxZ031ufRvXA2kVSNZd2s4gGolPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1Ld41VwShAqSWIAgZwNEvvZ-VVzIM9DgCRyai9DQRzEg&oe=69EE1232"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Z27COrXGggQ7kNvwGepLKm&_nc_oc=AdrODFpnsRhYI9S36yven3obRzni2_W3aCahOHnjYxH1o-CxkC0kPBHHgPJCUcX-y8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1qeBfqAS6pUpisvPsRrR-gIQ0a25ooVgy8yY5LJEZ3rw&oe=69EE1FD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p